ius:10px;padding:12px 14px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1;color:var(--text)\">Messages</b>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\">＋</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:7px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;flex:none;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand),#8b5cf6);color:#fff;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px\">M</span>\n        <span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">Maya Lin <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">sent you the final draft</span></span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">10:24</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:7px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;flex:none;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f7ba1e,#f76965);color:#fff;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px\">✦</span>\n        <span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">Inspo Digest <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">this week's picks are live</span></span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">09:02</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--border-light);background:linear-gradient(160deg,#f7f9ff,#e3e9ff);padding:12px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Monthly Active Users</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin:4px 0 2px\">12,408</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--green)\">↑ 8.2% vs last month</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--border-light);background:linear-gradient(160deg,#f7f9ff,#e3e9ff);padding:12px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Avg. Session Length</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin:4px 0 2px\">6m 42s</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--green)\">↑ 3.1% vs last month</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"grad-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"start\"><span class=\"grad-anat-dot\" style=\"background:#165dff\"></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"direction\"><span class=\"grad-anat-arrow\">⟶</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"stop\"><span class=\"grad-anat-bar\"><i class=\"grad-anat-stop\"></i></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"end\"><span class=\"grad-anat-dot\" style=\"background:#722ed1\"></span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"start","cn":"起点色","en":"Start","desc":"渐变从它开始","desc_en":"Where the gradient begins"},{"key":"direction","cn":"方向","en":"Direction","desc":"线性渐变的角度，决定流动感","desc_en":"The angle of a linear gradient — it sets the sense of flow"},{"key":"stop","cn":"色标","en":"Color Stop","desc":"中途的停靠色，能做三色以上","desc_en":"Midway colors — add more for three-color blends and beyond"},{"key":"end","cn":"终点色","en":"End","desc":"渐变到它结束","desc_en":"Where the gradient lands"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"线性渐变","en":"Linear","demo":"<span class=\"grad-v grad-linear\"></span>","when":"Hero 背景，方向感带来活力","when_en":"Hero backgrounds — direction brings energy"},{"cn":"径向渐变","en":"Radial","demo":"<span class=\"grad-v grad-radial\"></span>","when":"聚焦主体，营造光晕氛围","when_en":"Focuses the subject with a halo effect"},{"cn":"双色调","en":"Duotone","demo":"<span class=\"grad-v grad-duo\"></span>","when":"年轻潮流的品牌活动页","when_en":"Young, trendy campaign pages"},{"cn":"同色系深浅","en":"Tonal","demo":"<span class=\"grad-v grad-mono\"></span>","when":"想保持克制、又需要轻微层次时","when_en":"When you want subtle depth without introducing another hue"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>线性渐变做 Hero 背景</b>：方向感带来向前的活力","m":"grad-linear"},{"t":"<b>径向渐变做聚焦</b>：光晕把视线聚到主体上","m":"grad-radial"},{"t":"<b>双色调 / 多色</b>：撞色渐变适合活动页和年轻品牌，能带来更鲜明的潮流感","m":"grad-duo"},{"t":"<b>同色系深浅</b>：可用于 {c:card} 或背景营造层次；先检查文字与状态的对比度，不把“高级感”当结果保证","m":"grad-mono"}],"dont":[{"t":"将<b>高饱和对比渐变用于正文背景</b>：可能干扰文字阅读","m":"grad-bg-bad","bad":true},{"t":"文字叠在渐变上<b>未验证对比度</b>：不同区域可能难以辨认","m":"grad-text-bad","bad":true},{"t":"渐变<b>方向和色系缺少规则</b>：会削弱页面的视觉一致性","m":"grad-mess","bad":true},{"t":"一个页面<b>多处使用渐变</b>：视觉重点难以区分","m":"grad-everywhere","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"Hero 使用蓝到紫的渐变背景，白色标题在中间清楚，但靠近浅色一端几乎看不见。怎样修正？","options":[{"id":"contrast-checked-gradient","label":"调整色阶或文字区域，使整段背景都满足可读性，并准备纯色回退","feedback":"渐变每个位置都可能成为文字背景，只有检查完整区域才能保证标题持续可读。","correct":true},{"id":"saturated-text-background","label":"增加更多高饱和颜色，让渐变更醒目并盖过文字问题","feedback":"更强的颜色变化会进一步干扰正文，不能替代前景与各区域的对比度检查。","correct":false},{"id":"repeat-gradient-everywhere","label":"把同一渐变复制到卡片、按钮和页脚，依靠重复形成全站统一","feedback":"重复重点效果会削弱 Hero 的主次，也把对比度风险扩散到更多内容。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A hero uses a blue-to-purple gradient. Its white heading reads well in the center but nearly disappears at the light end. How should it be fixed?","options":[{"id":"contrast-checked-gradient","label":"Adjust color stops or the text region for readability across the full area and provide a solid fallback","feedback":"Every gradient position can sit behind the heading, so the entire text region must preserve contrast.","correct":true},{"id":"saturated-text-background","label":"Add more saturated colors so the gradient looks stronger and overpowers the text issue","feedback":"Stronger color variation further competes with copy and cannot replace contrast checks across the background.","correct":false},{"id":"repeat-gradient-everywhere","label":"Repeat the same gradient across cards, buttons, and footer to create site-wide consistency","feedback":"Repeating a focal effect weakens hierarchy and spreads the same contrast risk to more content.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请保留 Hero 蓝紫渐变，但检查标题可能覆盖的每个区域，调整色阶、遮罩或文字位置确保可读，并提供纯色回退。不要把同一渐变铺满全页；在深浅模式和窄屏换行下重新验收。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Keep the blue-purple hero gradient but check every area behind the heading, adjusting stops, overlay, or placement for readability and adding a solid fallback. Do not spread it across the page; retest themes and mobile wrapping."}},"references":[{"title":"linear-gradient() 线性渐变","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/gradient/linear-gradient","title_en":"linear-gradient()"}],"scenes":["Hero 区大背景","品牌活动页","图标与头像点缀","卡片微渐变底色"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Create a soft hero background","m":"grad-linear"},{"t":"Show a value range or heat scale","m":"grad-radial"},{"t":"Add depth to a decorative surface","m":"grad-duo"},{"t":"Connect two related brand colors","m":"grad-mono"}],"dont":[{"t":"Place text over a region with changing low contrast","m":"grad-bg-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Combine too many unrelated colors","m":"grad-text-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Use a gradient on every surface","m":"grad-mess","bad":true},{"t":"Treat a decorative blend as a data scale","m":"grad-everywhere","bad":true}],"scenes":["Hero background","Data scale","Button accent","Illustration surface"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--brand),#8b5cf6)\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:8px 14px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#fff\">Flowbase</span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85)\">Product　Pricing　Log in</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:12px 14px 18px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35;color:#fff\">Teamwork that<br>finally flows</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);margin:6px 0 10px\">Free for 14 days. Cancel anytime.</div>\n        <button class=\"btn\" style=\"bac